<div dir="ltr"><span id="gmail-docs-internal-guid-d16ebe36-7fff-3a36-9d8a-b700829dfef7"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;white-space:pre-wrap">Hi Modern Kitchen marketing team,</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap">We're thinking of doing a happy hour for people in the company who will be at the conference this week, so people from different offices can get to know each other in-person. Please fill out this <a href="https://qualtrics.com/mkitchen/conference-happy-hour-signup">form</a> to RSVP and to let us know if you prefer Wednesday or Thursday. We highly encourage everyone to attend!</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap">Best regards,</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap">Jessica Miller</span></p></span><br class="gmail-Apple-interchange-newline"></div>
